00:00:18.814 --> 00:00:20.223
- It's this thing called the rule of 10.

00:00:20.223 --> 00:00:22.631
The rule of 10 is, three
people going to like it,

00:00:22.631 --> 00:00:23.953
three people not going to like, and

00:00:23.953 --> 00:00:26.531
four people just going to
be on the fence about it,

00:00:26.531 --> 00:00:28.151
like they just going to
kind of remain neutral

00:00:28.151 --> 00:00:30.325
and just wait to see what happens.

00:00:30.325 --> 00:00:32.458
I use that whenever I,

00:00:32.458 --> 00:00:34.822
