however I approach anything

00:00:34.822 --> 00:00:37.855
like a TV show or the
radio show for that day

00:00:37.855 --> 00:00:40.136
or a statement I might make.

00:00:40.136 --> 00:00:43.173
Like, three people going to
agree with it, three people not,

00:00:43.173 --> 00:00:44.302
and four people just going
to be on the fence about it.

00:00:44.302 --> 00:00:46.473
So, you just have to take all of that

00:00:46.473 --> 00:00:47.724
in to consideration and that kind of

00:00:47.724 --> 00:00:49.794
goes into something my father
told me a long time ago.

00:00:49.794 --> 00:00:52.255
My father said, "You're never
as good as they say you are,

00:00:52.255 --> 00:00:53.088
and you're never as

00:00:53.088 --> 00:00:54.545
bad as the say you are."
- That's a fact.

00:00:54.545 --> 00:00:57.248
- Personally, I just
don't care either way.

00:00:57.248 --> 00:00:58.661
- Yeah.
- Like you know what I mean?

00:00:58.661 --> 00:00:59.838
The only thing I got to do is
- You got to do your job

00:00:59.838 --> 00:01:01.505
