help me be the best me.

00:02:28.334 --> 00:02:30.302
And I want you to do the same.

00:02:30.302 --> 00:02:32.380
Don't try to be the next anybody,

00:02:32.380 --> 00:02:33.959
just be the best you.

00:02:33.959 --> 00:02:35.029
That's where you're going to win,

00:02:35.029 --> 00:02:38.543
